  "privacySection1Title": "1. Information We Collect",
  "privacySection1Content": "GPTesting is a purely local tool. We do not collect any personal identity information.\n• App List: To help you with Google Play testing, we need to access your installed apps. This data is only used for display and check-in within the app, and is never uploaded to any server.\n• Check-in Records: Your test check-in times are stored locally on your device.",
  "privacySection2Title": "2. Permission Usage",
  "privacySection2Content": "To implement core features, we require the following permissions:\n• QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES: To scan installed test apps on your device.\n• Storage/Photo Permission: To save generated report images to your gallery.\n• Network Permission: Only used to check if an app is live on Google Play Store. No personal data is uploaded.",
